Emerging Fraud Spotlight: Deepfake Video Conference Fraud (Hong Kong)
Fraud Overview
AI-generated video and voice impersonated the CFO and senior executives.
Employee attended a fake video conference that appeared genuine.
Victim was instructed to process urgent confidential payments.
15 fund transfers were made to 5 local bank accounts.
Total loss: HK$200 million (≈ US$25 million).
No malware or credential compromise—the payment was authorized by the employee. �
